# Root reference only — each app loads its own env file:
#   apps/api/.env       (copy from apps/api/.env.example)
#   apps/web/.env.local  (copy from apps/web/.env.example)
#
# NOTE (Phase 1 / local dev only): apps/api uses a local SQLite file as its
# datasource because this environment has no Docker and no accessible local
# Postgres credentials. The approved architecture targets PostgreSQL +
# TimescaleDB (see docs/ARCHITECTURE.md and infra/docker-compose.yml) — this
# is a documented Phase 1 stopgap, not a change of target database.
